{
    "title": "Parental Control App- FamiSafe",
    "description": "With the latest version of FamiSafe, the Screen Viewer feature now enables remote screen capture on Windows and Mac. This allows you to monitor your child's PC activities, helping you gain deeper insights into their behavior and steer them toward age-appropriate content.\r\n\r\n<b>FamiSafe \u2013 Parental Control App</b> is designed for caring parents to track where their child is, monitor how much time they spend using their phone, find out what apps they download, and understand who they are talking with.\r\n\r\n<b>How can FamiSafe \u2013 Parental Control App help protect your child? </b>  \r\n\r\n<b>Monitor Online Activities </b> \u2013 Want to know what your child does with their phone every day? Concerned they might visit dangerous content? FamiSafe can help you monitor their online activities, including how much time they spend on each app and which websites they visit, What videos do they watch on youtube and tiktok.\r\n\r\n<b>Calls & Messages Monitoring</b>\r\n- Stay informed by monitoring your child's calls and texts, with keyword detection to ensure their safety from potential dangers.\r\n\r\n<b>Location Tracker</b> \u2013 Worried when your child doesn\u2019t respond, or when they're not by your side? FamiSafe's highly accurate GPS location tracker can help you know where they are and their historical whereabouts.\r\n\r\n<b>Screen Time Control</b> \u2013 Concerned about your child becoming addicted to mobile phones? FamiSafe\u2019s screen time controller can help you customize screen time limits, such as less screen time on school days and more on weekends.\r\n\r\n<b>Blocksite & App Blocker</b> \u2013 FamiSafe \u2013 App Blocker helps guide your child to age-appropriate content by filtering inappropriate web pages and blocking adult apps, such as porn, dating apps, and certain gaming apps.\r\n\r\n<b>Screen Viewer</b> - Parents can remotely capture their children's screenshots to monitor and enforce appropriate phone usage. Remote screen capture is available for mobile devices, Windows and Mac.\r\n\r\n<b>One-Way Audio</b> \u2013 This newly released function allows you to listen to your child's surroundings, so you can confirm whether they are safe outside.\r\n\r\n<b>Panic Button</b> \u2013 If your child feels threatened when they are alone, they can use the SOS button on <b>FamiSafe Kids</b>. You will receive an SOS alert with their accurate location information, so you can help them right away.\r\n\r\n<b>Sensitive words & sexual picture detection</b> - with FamiSafe Parental Control App you can easily detect sensitive content on your child\u2019s phone, including keywords (such as drugs, addiction, depression, suicide, etc.) and sensitive pictures across various platforms like WhatsApp, Facebook, Snapchat, Discord, YouTube, Instagram, Twitter, and other apps.\r\n\r\nCompared to a spy app, FamiSafe is more like a family link, allowing parents to understand their child better and help them develop good digital device usage habits.\r\n\r\nTo start protecting your child\r\n1.Download the <b>Parental Control App \u2013 FamiSafe</b> on your phone.\r\n2.Download <b>FamiSafe Kids</b> on your child\u2019s phone. \r\n3.Pair the devices with the code to monitor your child remotely.\r\n\r\nA paid parent account can bind <b>more than 5 children's devices</b> at the same time, and parents can be added for <b>co-parenting</b>.\r\n\r\nFamiSafe <b>does not contain any advertisement</b>.\r\n\r\nWhy should you choose FamiSafe- Parental Control App?\r\nRecognized and trusted by many organizations and associations\r\n* Best Products for Elementary Kids 2024\r\n* National Parenting Product Awards Winner 2024\r\n* Best Middle & High School Products 2024\r\n* Best Family Health & Safety Products 2024\r\n\r\n---POLICIES & TERMS OF USE---\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.wondershare.com/privacy.html \r\nTerms of Use: https://famisafe.wondershare.com/terms-of-use.html\r\n\r\nWebsite: https://famisafe.wondershare.com/\r\nContact US: customer_service@wondershare.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "With the latest version of FamiSafe, the Screen Viewer feature now enables remote screen capture on Windows and Mac. This allows you to monitor your child&#39;s PC activities, helping you gain deeper insights into their behavior and steer them toward age-appropriate content.<br><br><b>FamiSafe \u2013 Parental Control App</b> is designed for caring parents to track where their child is, monitor how much time they spend using their phone, find out what apps they download, and understand who they are talking with.<br><br><b>How can FamiSafe \u2013 Parental Control App help protect your child? </b>  <br><br><b>Monitor Online Activities </b> \u2013 Want to know what your child does with their phone every day? Concerned they might visit dangerous content? FamiSafe can help you monitor their online activities, including how much time they spend on each app and which websites they visit, What videos do they watch on youtube and tiktok.<br><br><b>Calls &amp; Messages Monitoring</b><br>- Stay informed by monitoring your child&#39;s calls and texts, with keyword detection to ensure their safety from potential dangers.<br><br><b>Location Tracker</b> \u2013 Worried when your child doesn\u2019t respond, or when they&#39;re not by your side? FamiSafe&#39;s highly accurate GPS location tracker can help you know where they are and their historical whereabouts.<br><br><b>Screen Time Control</b> \u2013 Concerned about your child becoming addicted to mobile phones? FamiSafe\u2019s screen time controller can help you customize screen time limits, such as less screen time on school days and more on weekends.<br><br><b>Blocksite &amp; App Blocker</b> \u2013 FamiSafe \u2013 App Blocker helps guide your child to age-appropriate content by filtering inappropriate web pages and blocking adult apps, such as porn, dating apps, and certain gaming apps.<br><br><b>Screen Viewer</b> - Parents can remotely capture their children&#39;s screenshots to monitor and enforce appropriate phone usage. Remote screen capture is available for mobile devices, Windows and Mac.<br><br><b>One-Way Audio</b> \u2013 This newly released function allows you to listen to your child&#39;s surroundings, so you can confirm whether they are safe outside.<br><br><b>Panic Button</b> \u2013 If your child feels threatened when they are alone, they can use the SOS button on <b>FamiSafe Kids</b>. You will receive an SOS alert with their accurate location information, so you can help them right away.<br><br><b>Sensitive words &amp; sexual picture detection</b> - with FamiSafe Parental Control App you can easily detect sensitive content on your child\u2019s phone, including keywords (such as drugs, addiction, depression, suicide, etc.) and sensitive pictures across various platforms like WhatsApp, Facebook, Snapchat, Discord, YouTube, Instagram, Twitter, and other apps.<br><br>Compared to a spy app, FamiSafe is more like a family link, allowing parents to understand their child better and help them develop good digital device usage habits.<br><br>To start protecting your child<br>1.Download the <b>Parental Control App \u2013 FamiSafe</b> on your phone.<br>2.Download <b>FamiSafe Kids</b> on your child\u2019s phone. <br>3.Pair the devices with the code to monitor your child remotely.<br><br>A paid parent account can bind <b>more than 5 children&#39;s devices</b> at the same time, and parents can be added for <b>co-parenting</b>.<br><br>FamiSafe <b>does not contain any advertisement</b>.<br><br>Why should you choose FamiSafe- Parental Control App?<br>Recognized and trusted by many organizations and associations<br>* Best Products for Elementary Kids 2024<br>* National Parenting Product Awards Winner 2024<br>* Best Middle &amp; High School Products 2024<br>* Best Family Health &amp; Safety Products 2024<br><br>---POLICIES &amp; TERMS OF USE---<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.wondershare.com/privacy.html <br>Terms of Use: https://famisafe.wondershare.com/terms-of-use.html<br